flowchart LR
  A[Submit event application, plan and documents] --> B[Content team reviews application]
  B --> C[Assign checklist and custom risk items]
  C --> D[Organizer confirms every item]
  D --> E[Compliance reviews every item]
  E --> F{Compliant?}
  F -- No --> G[Reject with recorded reason]
  G --> C
  F -- Yes --> H[Verify items]
  H --> I{Both signatures complete?}
  I -- No --> J[Block clearance]
  J --> D
  I -- Yes --> K[Clear event for release]
  K --> L[Append audit record]
